        "description": "Identification of pathogenic variants in USH2A, GPR98, or DFNB31 genes",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of moderate to severe congenital sensorineural hearing loss and retinitis pigmentosa with normal vestibular function, supported by genetic testing if available",
    "notes": "Vestibular function testing helps differentiate Type II from Type I Usher syndrome."
